("long:'整套视觉系统从天体运行的几何节律出发", "long:'The whole visual system starts from the geometric rhythm of celestial motion, building an identity and wayfinding language designed to grow. We designed 12 dynamic marks around the solar terms plus a modular wayfinding system covering the entire building, so every upward glance lets visitors feel time flowing.\\n\\nThe project ran 11 months across identity development, custom type, spatial wayfinding, web, print, and digital assets. The final system is now deployed across all 18,000 square meters of the museum.',"),
