("long:'《无名之地》是为上海西岸艺术中心北侧旧厂房做的临时灯光介入", "long:'“Nameless Ground” is a temporary light intervention in the old factory buildings north of the West Bund Art Center in Shanghai. We placed a group of low-intensity warm-white light bands along an 18-meter steel beam — nearly invisible by day, emerging gradually after dusk.\\n\\nThe work points at no theme — its purpose is to let that long-overlooked industrial space be seen once more. All materials were recycled after the show.',"),
