("long:'《字非字》是工作室 2024–2025 年的一项内部实验", "long:'“Not Quite Characters” is an internal studio experiment from 2024–2025 that produced 286 glyphs.\\n\\nThese glyphs never quite \\\"form words\\\" — they are what remains when CJK structures are deconstructed, extracted, and re-preserved. The full set is released publicly as a variable font for research use.',"),
