("desc:'在严肃与可亲之间寻找平衡", "desc:'Finding the balance between serious and approachable. The two characters for \"square\" and \"circle\" became the geometric core of the whole visual.',"),
("long:'方圆律师事务所是一家专注于商业并购的中型律所", "long:'Fangyuan Law Firm is a mid-size practice focused on M&A. We redesigned its brand system around the geometric relationship between the characters for \"square\" and \"circle\", covering business cards, legal documents, signing sets, the website, and office signage.\\n\\nThe core idea: a law firm' + APOS + 's brand should feel professional and human at once.',"),
