("long:'《明月几时有》是与中央美术学院实验艺术学院合作的一次互动叙事项目", "long:'“When Will the Moon Be Clear” is an interactive narrative project with the Experimental Art school of the Central Academy of Fine Arts. We took Su Shi' + APOS + 's lyric of the same name and re-deconstructed it into 28 semantic units.\\n\\nHow long the cursor lingers shapes the narrative path — the longer the pause, the quieter the next line leans; the quicker the pass, the more restless. Every reading is its own version.',"),
