("desc:'影像艺术空间的官方网站", "desc:'Website for a moving-image art space. The whole site is built around slow scrolling, so browsing itself becomes a way of watching.',"),
("long:'沉影是一家以影像作品为主的当代艺术空间", "long:'Sunken Shadow is a contemporary art space centered on moving-image work, curating 4–6 shows a year. We designed its website — no popups, no modals, no hover animations anywhere; everything unfolds through scroll.\\n\\nScroll speed is deliberately reduced by 40%, so visitors cannot skim and have to stop. That is isomorphic with their curatorial idea.',"),
