("desc:'由温感面料构成的可呼吸墙体", "desc:'A breathable wall made of thermosensitive fabric. As viewers approach, the wall swells at the frequency of body heat.',"),
("long:'《呼吸的墙》是 2023 年在北京 798 艺术区一个临时空间内展示的作品", "long:'“The Breathing Wall” showed in 2023 in a temporary space in Beijing' + APOS + 's 798 art district. The wall is built from a thermosensitive fabric covering a 6×3-meter surface.\\n\\nBehind it hide 24 micro air pumps — when infrared senses a viewer approaching, they inflate and deflate the wall at a frequency approximating the visitor' + APOS + 's heartbeat. The wall begins to \\\"breathe\\\".',"),
