("long:'《声音地形》是为上海当代艺术馆 2024 年秋季群展所做的一件 17 分钟的步行式声音装置", "long:'“Sound Terrain” is a 17-minute walk-through sound installation made for the Museum of Contemporary Art Shanghai' + APOS + 's autumn 2024 group show.\\n\\nBeneath the gallery floor we laid 96 micro speakers on independent channels, each playing an ambient recording no longer than 2 seconds. Visitors' + APOS + ' footsteps trigger different speaker combinations — the same path sounds completely different at different walking rhythms.',"),
