("long:'《水镜》是受苏州博物馆邀请", "long:'“Water Mirror” is a permanent piece commissioned by the Suzhou Museum for its newly built courtyard: a 12-square-meter mirror pool only 5 millimeters deep, set into the bluestone platform at the courtyard' + APOS + 's south end.\\n\\nWater circulates in extremely slowly from one side so the surface stays mirror-flat. What it reflects: the museum' + APOS + 's white walls, its roof ridges, and a plum tree in the distance.',"),
