("desc:'为上海双年展所做的主视觉系统", "desc:'The key visual system for the Shanghai Biennale. A sheet of paper folded again and again leaves an irreversible geography.',"),
("long:'《时间的褶皱》是 2023 上海双年展的主视觉与海报系统", "long:'“Folds of Time” is the key visual and poster system of the 2023 Shanghai Biennale. Our method was literal — 36 full sheets of paper were folded by hand, flattened, and scanned as the visual base.\\n\\nEvery crease marks one intervention of time. The final key visual evolved from six selected \\\"crease maps\\\" and ran across posters, catalogs, signage, and merchandise.',"),
