("long:'《空亭》是为西塘古镇 2023 年秋季艺术周设计的一处临时建筑", "long:'“Empty Pavilion” is a temporary structure for the Xitang Ancient Town autumn art week 2023. Thirty-six seamless white steel tubes connected with a minimum of joints form an open 3.6-meter pavilion — no walls, no roof, no ornament.\\n\\nIt stood at the water' + APOS + 's edge south of the old town and was fully dismantled three months later. We deliberately gave it no visual design or signage — its value is the time it existed.',"),
