("long:'《字图》是工作室主理人沈白自 2024 年开始的每日练习", "long:'“Glyph Diary” is a daily practice the studio' + APOS + 's founder Shen Bai started in 2024 — one sheet a day, brush and xuan paper, recording a character or a group of strokes. This is no. 047.\\n\\nThe point is not calligraphy but observation — watching ink spread and stop on paper, watching the relation between gesture and breath. The full 365 sheets are being planned toward a 2027 book.',"),
