("long:'《夜半笔记》是一组在 2024 年间断续记录的速写", "long:'“Midnight Notes” is a set of sketches recorded on and off through 2024, most finished deep in the night. The subjects point at nothing in particular — a fragment of conversation, an object that does not yet exist, an unnamed feeling.\\n\\nThey were never bound into a book and never published, but the studio considers them the most honest work of the year.',"),
